  "title": "Party Potatoes",
  "description": "Rich, creamy party potatoes are a blend of mashed potatoes, sour cream, cream cheese, and butter that can be made ahead and baked the next day.",
  "authors": [
    "Beth Neuenfeldt"
  ],
